  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "At Shang Xin Ci’s succession ceremony on Shang Liang Mountain he asks whether she can really lead Shang clan, maintain stability, or expand after the battle of Yi Tian Mountain threw Southern Border into its biggest commotion in several hundred years. Shang Qing Qing answers that she chose Shang Xin Ci for heart and magnanimity rather than ability alone. Shang Tan Mo is moved and follows her indication to look down at the loyal subordinates on the mountain peak.",
      "chapters": [
        1072
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_shang_xin_ci",
        "loc_shang_liang_mountain",
        "fac_shang_clan",
        "loc_yi_tian_mountain",
        "reg_southern_border",
        "char_shang_qing_qing"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "He has the appearance of a youth. He wears a blue robe and is skinny. He looks at Shang Xin Ci with a deep gaze of doubt and inquisitiveness.",
      "chapters": [
        1072
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Beside Shang Qing Qing after Shang Xin Ci leaves, he is thin and looks very pale.",
      "chapters": [
        1111
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "After Shang Xin Ci leaves Shang Qing Qing, he appears beside her and asks if she is letting the clan leader go. He says solemnly that they cannot listen to her words alone and need to soul search to see for themselves. When Shang Qing Qing shows a twig-like hand with flowers on her nails from an immortal killer move, he is dazed and admits he forgot that method is more reliable than soul searching. Assured that Fang Yuan left no hidden schemes in Shang clan city, he asks how they will explain this to outsiders. His eyes shine as his gaze pierces Shang Liang Mountain toward the giant dream realm, and he says Shang clan’s Gu Immortals have been too polite for a long time, so people think they are no longer adept at fighting.",
      "chapters": [
        1111
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "dream-realm-pressure",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "loc_shang_clan_city",
        "sys_gu_immortal"
      ]
    }
  ],
